      "y": 667.44,
      "width": 61.08,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 133.08,
      "visualLineId": 5,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 18,
      "str": "",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 641.76,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 0,
      "right": 76,
      "visualLineId": null,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 19,
      "str": "One example of a verifier impersonation-resistant authentication protocol is client-authenticated",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 641.76,
      "width": 461.52,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 533.52,
      "visualLineId": 6,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 20,
      "str": "TLS, because the client signs the authenticator output along with earlier messages from the",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 628.08,
      "width": 437.33,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 509.33,
      "visualLineId": 7,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 21,
      "str": "protocol that are unique to the particular TLS connection being negotiated.",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 613.92,
      "width": 358.92,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 430.92,
      "visualLineId": 8,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 22,
      "str": "",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 588.48,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 0,
      "right": 76,
      "visualLineId": null,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 23,
      "str": "Authenticators that involve the manual entry of an authenticator output, such as out-of-band and",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 588.48,
      "width": 461.76,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 533.76,
      "visualLineId": 9,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 24,
      "str": "OTP authenticators, SHALL NOT be considered verifier impersonation-resistant because the",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 574.56,
      "width": 447.17,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 519.17,
      "visualLineId": 10,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 25,
      "str": "manual entry does not bind the authenticator output to the specific session being authenticated.",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 560.88,
      "width": 455.16,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 527.16,
      "visualLineId": 11,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 26,
      "str": "In a MitM attack, an impostor verifier could replay the OTP authenticator output to the verifier",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 546.96,
      "width": 455.91,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 527.91,
      "visualLineId": 12,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 27,
      "str": "and successfully authenticate.",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 533.04,
      "width": 142.92,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 214.92,
      "visualLineId": 13,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 28,
      "str": "",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 508.08,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 0,
      "right": 76,
      "visualLineId": null,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
