      "right": 115.94,
      "visualLineId": 16,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 38,
      "str": "Figure 4-1), communications between the verifier and CSP SHALL occur through a",
      "x": 118.8,
      "y": 468.96,
      "width": 403.73,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 522.53,
      "visualLineId": 16,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 39,
      "str": "mutually-authenticated secure channel (such as a client-authenticated TLS connection) using",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 455.04,
      "width": 445.44,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 517.44,
      "visualLineId": 17,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 40,
      "str": "approved cryptography.",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 441.12,
      "width": 114.84,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 186.84,
      "visualLineId": 18,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
