      "right": 97.66,
      "visualLineId": 19,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 44,
      "str": "Verifier-Compromise Resistance",
      "x": 107.99,
      "y": 416.16,
      "width": 170.08,
      "height": 11.04,
      "right": 278.07,
      "visualLineId": 19,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 45,
      "str": "",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 390.96,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 0,
      "right": 76,
      "visualLineId": null,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 46,
      "str": "Use of some types of authenticators requires that the verifier store a copy of the authenticator",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 390.96,
      "width": 447.52,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 519.52,
      "visualLineId": 20,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 47,
      "str": "secret. For example, an OTP authenticator (described in",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 377.04,
      "width": 268.32,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 340.32,
      "visualLineId": 21,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 48,
      "str": " ",
      "x": 340.32,
      "y": 377.04,
      "width": 0.24,
      "height": 0,
      "right": 340.56,
      "visualLineId": 21,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 49,
      "str": "Section 5.1.4",
      "x": 343.2,
      "y": 377.04,
      "width": 63.36,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 406.56,
      "visualLineId": 21,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 50,
      "str": ") requires that the verifier",
      "x": 406.32,
      "y": 377.04,
      "width": 122.56,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 528.88,
      "visualLineId": 21,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 51,
      "str": "independently generate the authenticator output for comparison against the value sent by the",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 363.36,
      "width": 443.33,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 515.33,
      "visualLineId": 22,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 52,
      "str": "claimant. Because of the potential for the verifier to be compromised and stored secrets stolen,",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 349.44,
      "width": 453.72,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 525.72,
      "visualLineId": 23,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 53,
      "str": "authentication protocols that do not require the verifier to persistently store secrets that could be",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 335.76,
      "width": 460.61,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 532.61,
      "visualLineId": 24,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 54,
      "str": "used for authentication are considered stronger, and are described herein as being",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 321.84,
      "width": 390.48,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 462.48,
      "visualLineId": 25,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 55,
      "str": " ",
      "x": 462.48,
      "y": 321.84,
      "width": 0.26,
      "height": 0,
      "right": 462.74,
      "visualLineId": 25,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 56,
      "str": "verifier",
      "x": 465.6,
      "y": 321.84,
      "width": 35.15,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 500.75,
      "visualLineId": 25,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 57,
      "str": "compromise resistant",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 308.16,
      "width": 102.7,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 174.7,
      "visualLineId": 26,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 58,
      "str": ". Note that such verifiers are not resistant to all attacks. A verifier could be",
      "x": 174.72,
      "y": 308.16,
      "width": 358.36,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 533.08,
      "visualLineId": 26,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 59,
      "str": "compromised in a different way, such as being manipulated into always accepting a particular",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 294.24,
      "width": 450.39,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 522.39,
      "visualLineId": 27,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 60,
      "str": "authenticator output.",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 280.32,
      "width": 99.48,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 171.48,
      "visualLineId": 28,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 61,
      "str": "",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 254.4,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 0,
      "right": 76,
      "visualLineId": null,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 62,
      "str": "Verifier compromise resistance can be achieved in different ways, for example:",
      "x": 72,
